Official BLAKE3 C sources vendored from:

  https://github.com/BLAKE3-team/BLAKE3
  tag: 1.8.2

The upstream C implementation and LICENSE_CC0 are included unchanged except
that blake3.h declares ecopy's two compatibility helpers. blake3_wrapper.c is
project code that supplies the existing one-shot blake3_hash() API and reports
the runtime-selected backend for diagnostics.

Architecture-specific files are compiled with isolated ISA flags. Runtime
dispatch remains in upstream blake3_dispatch.c, and blake3_portable.c is always
linked as the fallback.
